tick=5 note the owner's deletion is observed with its teardown deadline already behind the clock, as a member of each gang is lost, the template moves on and the operation deadline elapses; the release consults none of them and the escalation pass does not run under teardown, so the finalizer goes and both rows are purged with the owner
tick=5 apply spec.teardown[deleted] teardown=true now=t+0s
tick=5 apply pod.deleted[source] pod=svc-a-engine-0-worker-0 now=t+0s
